  "In this scenario you will have command of a French nuclear fast attack submarine (SSN). Using pop-up messages, you will be guided through the following topics:": "在本想定中，您將指揮一艘法國海軍核動力攻擊潛艦 (SSN)。通過彈窗訊息引導，您將學習以下內容：",
  "How to engage surface targets with torpedos": "如何使用魚雷攻擊水面目標",
  "Your mission is to destroy the merchant vessel transiting your area with torpedoes.": "您的任務是使用魚雷擊毀正在穿過任務海區的商船。",
  "In this tutorial as with others in this series multiple pop-ups will appear with important messages. If you need to review any of these later, you can open the message history in a second window by pressing Ctrl+Shift+M and scrolling to the appropriate message.": "在本教程及本系列其他教程中，重要提示將以彈窗形式出現。若稍後需要回顧，可按 Ctrl+Shift+M 在獨立視窗中打開訊息歷史記錄並滾動查閱。",
  "This tutorial is designed to stop time compression with pop-ups at important moments. Submarine operations are often slow paced due to their covert nature, so feel free to use time compression in the tutorial knowing that any significant developments will be accompanied by a time-stopping pop-up.": "本教程會在關鍵節點彈出訊息並自動暫停時間加速。鑑於潛艦作戰強調隱蔽、節奏較慢，您可放心使用時間加速，任何重大態勢變化都會自動彈窗暫停。",
  "To make use of this in your own game-play, or fine-tune pop-up settings for this tutorial go to Game > Game Options > Message Log and select 'Raise Pop-Up' for any event that you wish. Useful pop-ups for submarine operations include 'Contact Change', 'New Contact', 'Special Messages' (this should always be on), 'Unit Damage', 'Unit Lost' and 'New Weapon Contact'.": "若要在日常推演中使用此機制或微調彈窗設定，請前往「推演 > 推演選項 > 訊息日誌」，爲您關注的事件勾選「彈窗提示」。潛艦作戰常用的彈窗包括「目標接觸變更」、「新目標接觸」、「專用戰情訊息」（建議始終開啓）、「單位戰損」、「單位沉沒」與「新武器接觸」。",
